        <p><seg source="#source-19871-19891">思ひ出されて</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-19891-19924">どうもならぬ</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-19924-20009" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <div>
