        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-21317-21334">冬の風かよ</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-21334-21360">山吹く風は</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-21360-21377">冬の風だよ</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-21377-21400">あの風は</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-21400-21445">チヤチヤラチヤ　ヤツトサ</seg></p>
